WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:01.731
Think you can stay on?

2
00:00:01.868 --> 00:00:03.470
Twelve hamsters.

3
00:00:03.674 --> 00:00:05.053
One tiny island.

4
00:00:05.113 --> 00:00:06.620
Charge your dash...

5
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:07.830
and send them flying.

6
00:00:08.063 --> 00:00:09.351
Grab a skill.

7
00:00:09.444 --> 00:00:12.324
Blast, block, or swap your way out of trouble.

8
00:00:12.525 --> 00:00:13.979
Seven maps.

9
00:00:14.077 --> 00:00:15.120
Let it roll...

10
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:16.380
Volcano!

11
00:00:16.527 --> 00:00:17.754
Watch your step.

12
00:00:17.954 --> 00:00:19.469
Five modes.

13
00:00:19.595 --> 00:00:24.734
Fight to survive, race to the
finish, steal the flag, or just roam.

14
00:00:24.973 --> 00:00:26.133
Bring your friends.

15
00:00:26.386 --> 00:00:30.403
Share a code, party up, and
jump into the chaos together.

16
00:00:30.963 --> 00:00:31.831
Who's saving who?

17
00:00:32.071 --> 00:00:33.451
And now...

18
00:00:33.812 --> 00:00:34.710
the prize roll.

19
00:00:34.842 --> 00:00:36.391
Come on...

20
00:00:36.642 --> 00:00:37.434
come on...

21
00:00:37.834 --> 00:00:38.475
yes!

22
00:00:39.055 --> 00:00:40.576
Ninety-two looks.

23
00:00:40.745 --> 00:00:45.809
Twenty-three hamsters, twenty-nine
balls, thirty trails, and more.

24
00:00:46.084 --> 00:00:47.108
Go cute.

25
00:00:47.531 --> 00:00:48.184
Go cosmic.

26
00:00:48.384 --> 00:00:49.986
Go a little wild.

27
00:00:50.226 --> 00:00:52.653
Mix your hamster, ball, and trail.

28
00:00:52.813 --> 00:00:54.089
Three pieces.

29
00:00:54.149 --> 00:00:55.460
Your own look.

30
00:00:55.963 --> 00:00:57.049
Ready for one more round?

31
00:00:57.189 --> 00:00:58.552
Hamster Bounce.

32
00:00:58.752 --> 00:00:59.465
Roll.

33
00:00:59.937 --> 00:01:00.306
Charge.

34
00:01:00.689 --> 00:01:01.257
Send it.

35
00:01:01.437 --> 00:01:03.313
Get it on Google Play.
